('275', '13', 'key_benefits', 'a:10:{i:0;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:63:\"Rank for high-intent keywords that attract buyers, not browsers\";}i:1;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:69:\"Build a compounding organic traffic asset that grows month over month\";}i:2;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:61:\"Reduce cost per acquisition versus paid channels by up to 80%\";}i:3;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:65:\"Outrank competitors for the search terms that drive your industry\";}i:4;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:72:\"Establish topical authority that makes you the go-to brand in your niche\";}i:5;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:80:\"Future-proof your visibility across Google, AI Overviews, ChatGPT and Perplexity\";}i:6;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:62:\"Dominate local search for Dubai and UAE location-based queries\";}i:7;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:72:\"Build brand trust and credibility through consistent first-page presence\";}i:8;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:69:\"Transparent ROI reporting tied to leads, revenue, and business growth\";}i:9;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:81:\"Full technical foundation that makes every other marketing channel more effective\";}}'),
('276', '13', '_key_benefits', ''),
('277', '13', 'process_steps', '7'),
('278', '13', '_process_steps', 'field_svc_process'),
('279', '13', 'service_faq', 'a:12:{i:0;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:48:\"How long does SEO take to show results in Dubai?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:498:\"SEO is a compounding investment. Initial improvements in technical performance can be seen within 4–8 weeks. Ranking movements on target keywords typically begin in months 3–6, with significant organic traffic growth becoming evident in months 6–12. Highly competitive keywords in UAE markets (real estate, finance, legal) may take 12–18 months to reach page one consistently. The key is starting — the brands dominating organic search today are those who began investing 1–2 years ago.\";}i:1;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:32:\"How much does SEO cost in Dubai?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:407:\"SEO pricing in Dubai ranges from AED 3,000/month for small businesses with low-competition keywords to AED 25,000+/month for enterprise campaigns in highly competitive verticals. The right investment level depends on your target keywords\' competitiveness, your website\'s current state, the scope of content required, and how aggressively you want to grow. We\'ll provide a custom proposal after a free audit.\";}i:2;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:43:\"Does SEO work for Arabic search in the UAE?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:352:\"Absolutely, and it\'s one of the most underutilised opportunities for UAE businesses. Arabic-language SEO targets Emirati consumers and GCC visitors who search in Arabic — a highly valuable, under-competed audience. We produce native Arabic content optimised for search intent in both Modern Standard Arabic and Gulf dialect variations where relevant.\";}i:3;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:49:\"What\'s the difference between SEO and Google Ads?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:454:\"Google Ads delivers immediate visibility but costs you every click, and stops the moment you pause spending. SEO builds an organic traffic asset that grows over time — once you rank, you receive traffic without paying per click. The two work best together: Ads capture immediate demand while SEO builds long-term compounding traffic. Most UAE businesses benefit from running both, with the balance shifting toward organic over time as rankings improve.\";}i:4;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:45:\"Can you guarantee first-page Google rankings?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:510:\"No reputable SEO agency can guarantee specific Google rankings — Google\'s algorithm is complex and constantly evolving, and any agency making absolute ranking guarantees is being misleading. What we can guarantee is a rigorous, data-driven methodology proven to drive significant ranking improvements, documented performance improvements measured transparently, and full accountability to business metrics. We have an extensive track record of delivering first-page results for clients across UAE industries.\";}i:5;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:58:\"What is E-E-A-T and why does it matter for UAE businesses?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:509:\"E-E-A-T stands for Experience, Expertise, Authoritativeness, and Trustworthiness — Google\'s framework for evaluating content quality. Google uses E-E-A-T signals to determine which websites deserve to rank for important queries. For UAE businesses, demonstrating E-E-A-T means showcasing real credentials, featuring named experts and authors, earning links from authoritative UAE sources, collecting and displaying reviews, and creating content that demonstrates genuine first-hand knowledge of your market.\";}i:6;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:53:\"How does your SEO work for local businesses in Dubai?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:435:\"Local SEO for Dubai businesses involves a combination of Google Business Profile optimisation, local citation building across UAE directories, review generation strategy, locally-relevant content creation, and standard technical/on-page SEO. The local pack (map results) and organic results are both targets, and together they capture the majority of clicks for location-intent searches like \"SEO agency Dubai\" or \"accountant in DIFC\".\";}i:7;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:48:\"Do you offer SEO for e-commerce websites in UAE?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:356:\"Yes. E-commerce SEO requires specialist expertise — managing category page optimisation, product schema, faceted navigation, duplicate content from product variants, and the technical complexity of large-scale crawl management. We\'ve delivered strong organic growth for UAE e-commerce brands across fashion, electronics, food, and consumer goods sectors.\";}i:8;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:55:\"Will AI overviews (Google SGE) hurt my organic traffic?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:469:\"AI Overviews are reshaping search — but they also create opportunities for brands whose content is cited as a source within the AI-generated answers. We optimise content specifically to be cited in AI Overviews, featured snippets, and People Also Ask boxes, which actually increases brand visibility beyond standard organic rankings. Brands with strong topical authority and well-structured, fact-rich content are benefiting disproportionately from AI search changes.\";}i:9;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:31:\"How do you measure SEO success?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:451:\"We track rankings for target keywords, organic search traffic (sessions, users), organic-driven leads and conversions, organic revenue contribution (for e-commerce), share of voice versus competitors, and Core Web Vitals performance. Monthly reports and live dashboards show all metrics transparently. We work with your team to connect SEO performance to your CRM and sales pipeline data where possible, so we can demonstrate real revenue attribution.\";}i:10;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:58:\"What makes SEO.ae different from other Dubai SEO agencies?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:377:\"Three things: UAE market depth (8+ years, 345+ clients across every major industry), senior-led execution (your account is run by specialists, not juniors or offshore teams), and a revenue-first philosophy (we optimise for business outcomes, not vanity rankings). We also publish our methodologies, are transparent about timelines, and will never promise what we can\'t deliver.\";}i:11;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:55:\"Do I need to be on page 1 of Google to see SEO results?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:493:\"Page-one rankings are where the majority of traffic goes, but improvements earlier in the process deliver real value too. Technical fixes improve user experience and conversion rates. Content creation captures long-tail traffic. Early ranking improvements (page 3 to page 2, page 2 to page 1) each deliver incremental traffic gains. The full compounding benefit materialises once you\'re consistently ranking in positions 1–3 for priority terms, but every stage of the journey delivers value.\";}}'),
('280', '13', '_service_faq', ''),
('281', '13', 'technologies', '10');

INSERT INTO `wp_postmeta` (`meta_id`, `post_id`, `meta_key`, `meta_value`) VALUES
('282', '13', '_technologies', 'field_svc_technologies'),
('283', '15', 'key_benefits', 'a:8:{i:0;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:80:\"Immediate visibility for high-intent buyers actively searching for your services\";}i:1;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:78:\"Average 4.2x ROAS across our managed portfolio — every dirham working harder\";}i:2;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:64:\"Full account ownership — your data, your history, always yours\";}i:3;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:80:\"Senior PPC specialists managing your campaigns — no juniors, no offshore teams\";}i:4;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:77:\"Comprehensive attribution tracking so you know exactly what\'s driving revenue\";}i:5;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:87:\"Continuous A/B testing of ads, audiences, and landing pages for compounding improvement\";}i:6;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:78:\"Negative keyword management that eliminates budget waste on irrelevant traffic\";}i:7;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:76:\"Transparent monthly reporting with strategic commentary, not just data dumps\";}}'),
('284', '15', '_key_benefits', ''),
('285', '15', 'process_steps', '7'),
('286', '15', '_process_steps', 'field_svc_process'),
('287', '15', 'service_faq', 'a:12:{i:0;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:47:\"How much should I spend on Google Ads in Dubai?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:512:\"The right Google Ads budget depends on your industry, target keywords, and growth goals. As a starting point, you need enough budget to gather meaningful conversion data — typically a minimum of AED 5,000–10,000/month for most Dubai industries. Highly competitive sectors like real estate or legal require significantly more to be competitive. We\'ll recommend a specific budget range based on your keyword CPCs, conversion rate benchmarks for your industry, and the volume of leads or sales you\'re targeting.\";}i:1;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:46:\"What is a good ROAS for Google Ads in the UAE?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:474:\"Average ROAS varies significantly by industry and campaign type. E-commerce businesses typically target 3–6x ROAS (for every AED 1 spent, generating AED 3–6 in revenue). Lead generation businesses use cost per lead as the primary metric instead. Our managed portfolio averages 4.2x ROAS, but the right target for your business depends on your margins, customer lifetime value, and acquisition cost tolerance. We\'ll establish a custom target based on your unit economics.\";}i:2;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:54:\"How long does it take for Google Ads to start working?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:451:\"Google Ads can generate leads or sales from day one of launching — unlike SEO, which takes months to show results. However, campaigns typically improve significantly in the first 4–8 weeks as Smart Bidding algorithms learn and as we make optimisation improvements based on initial data. Expect the first 2–4 weeks to be a learning phase, with meaningful efficiency improvements in weeks 4–12 and continued compounding optimisation beyond that.\";}i:3;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:58:\"Should I use Google Ads or Meta Ads for my Dubai business?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:539:\"The answer is usually both — but with different objectives. Google Ads is ideal for capturing existing demand (people actively searching for what you offer). Meta Ads is ideal for creating demand (reaching people who match your ideal customer profile but aren\'t actively searching right now). B2C brands with visual products and broad audiences often see strong results from Meta. B2B and high-intent service businesses typically see better lead quality from Google Search. We\'ll recommend the right mix based on your specific situation.\";}i:4;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:45:\"What is Quality Score and why does it matter?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:449:\"Quality Score is Google\'s 1–10 rating of your keyword-ad-landing page relevance and expected performance. A higher Quality Score means Google rewards you with lower CPCs — a QS 10 keyword can cost 50% less per click than a QS 5 keyword for the same ad position. We actively manage Quality Scores by ensuring tight keyword-to-ad-copy relevance, improving expected CTR through ad copy testing, and optimising landing page relevance and experience.\";}i:5;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:51:\"Do you manage PPC for e-commerce businesses in UAE?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:409:\"Yes, and it\'s one of our strongest specialisms. E-commerce PPC requires Google Shopping expertise (product feed optimisation, campaign structure, Performance Max configuration), Dynamic Search Ads, and remarketing campaigns targeting cart abandoners and past purchasers. We\'ve delivered strong ROAS improvements for UAE e-commerce brands across fashion, electronics, beauty, home goods, and consumer products.\";}i:6;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:63:\"Can you take over management of an existing Google Ads account?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:401:\"Yes. We take over existing accounts regularly. We start with a comprehensive audit to understand the account\'s history, identify immediate quick wins, and flag structural issues. We then implement changes systematically — not all at once, as dramatic changes to a well-trained Smart Bidding account can disrupt performance. The transition is managed carefully to minimise any performance disruption.\";}i:7;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:59:\"How do you prevent click fraud in UAE Google Ads campaigns?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:407:\"Google has its own click fraud protection built in, but for campaigns in competitive UAE markets we also recommend and implement third-party click fraud protection (such as ClickCease or TrafficGuard) that provides more granular filtering. We also monitor traffic quality metrics regularly — bounce rate, time on site, conversion rate by source — to identify and exclude any suspicious traffic patterns.\";}i:8;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:50:\"What reporting will I receive on my PPC campaigns?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:425:\"You\'ll receive a comprehensive monthly performance report covering all key metrics: impressions, clicks, CTR, average CPC, conversions, conversion rate, cost per conversion, and ROAS. We also provide a live dashboard (Google Looker Studio) for real-time access to your campaign data. Monthly strategy calls review performance, discuss learnings, and align on the next month\'s priorities. Full transparency — no black boxes.\";}i:9;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:45:\"Do you offer PPC management for LinkedIn Ads?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:404:\"Yes. LinkedIn Ads is particularly effective for B2B UAE businesses targeting decision-makers by job title, seniority, industry, and company size. While LinkedIn CPCs are higher than Google or Meta, the lead quality and targeting precision for high-value B2B offers makes it extremely cost-effective for the right business type. We run LinkedIn Sponsored Content, Message Ads, and Lead Gen Form campaigns.\";}i:10;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:58:\"What happens to my ad accounts if I stop working with you?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:401:\"You retain full ownership of all ad accounts — always. If you end the engagement, we provide a full handover including account documentation, campaign structure explanation, and recommendations for the new manager. Your ad history, conversion data, and audience lists remain yours. We won\'t hold your accounts hostage or create dependency — your success is our success, and we operate accordingly.\";}i:11;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:57:\"How do you handle PPC for seasonal businesses in the UAE?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:499:\"Seasonality in the UAE is significant — Ramadan, summer slowdowns, the peak season October–March, and major events like Expo and DSF all affect search volumes and consumer behaviour. We plan campaign strategies around the UAE calendar: scaling budgets during peak periods, running awareness campaigns during slower periods to build pipeline for the next peak, and adjusting bid strategies and messaging for seasonal events. Proactive seasonal planning rather than reactive adjustment is the key.\";}}'),
