('672', '15', '_process_steps_2_step_title', 'field_proc_title'),
('673', '15', 'process_steps_2_step_desc', 'Comprehensive keyword research across all match types, combined with exhaustive negative keyword lists, ensures your budget reaches genuine buyers — not irrelevant searches that drain spend.'),
('674', '15', '_process_steps_2_step_desc', 'field_proc_desc'),
('675', '15', 'process_steps_3_step_title', 'Ad Copy & Landing Page Creation'),
('676', '15', '_process_steps_3_step_title', 'field_proc_title'),
('677', '15', 'process_steps_3_step_desc', 'Our copywriters create compelling, high-CTR ad copy with strong USPs and clear calls-to-action. We also build or optimise conversion-focused landing pages that turn clicks into enquiries and sales.'),
('678', '15', '_process_steps_3_step_desc', 'field_proc_desc'),
('679', '15', 'process_steps_4_step_title', 'Bid Strategy & Budget Allocation'),
('680', '15', '_process_steps_4_step_title', 'field_proc_title'),
('681', '15', 'process_steps_4_step_desc', 'We configure Smart Bidding strategies — Target CPA, Target ROAS, or Maximise Conversions — calibrated to your specific goals and historical performance data for optimal efficiency from day one.'),
('682', '15', '_process_steps_4_step_desc', 'field_proc_desc'),
('683', '15', 'process_steps_5_step_title', 'Continuous Optimisation'),
('684', '15', '_process_steps_5_step_title', 'field_proc_title'),
('685', '15', 'process_steps_5_step_desc', 'Weekly optimisation cycles adjust bids, pause underperforming ads, test new copy variations, expand keyword lists, and refine audience targeting to continuously improve performance and reduce wasted spend.'),
('686', '15', '_process_steps_5_step_desc', 'field_proc_desc'),
('687', '15', 'process_steps_6_step_title', 'Reporting & Strategic Reviews'),
('688', '15', '_process_steps_6_step_title', 'field_proc_title'),
('689', '15', 'process_steps_6_step_desc', 'Weekly performance snapshots and monthly strategy reports detail every metric — impressions, clicks, conversions, CPA, ROAS, and revenue. Quarterly reviews align campaign strategy with evolving business goals.'),
('690', '15', '_process_steps_6_step_desc', 'field_proc_desc'),
('691', '15', 'service_faqs', '10'),
('692', '15', '_service_faqs', 'field_svc_faqs'),
('693', '15', 'service_faqs_0_question', 'How much should a Dubai business spend on Google Ads?');

INSERT INTO `wp_postmeta` (`meta_id`, `post_id`, `meta_key`, `meta_value`) VALUES
('694', '15', '_service_faqs_0_question', 'field_faq_q'),
('695', '15', 'service_faqs_0_answer', '<p>A minimum viable budget for competitive UAE keywords is typically AED 5,000–10,000/month in ad spend. Highly competitive sectors like real estate, legal, or healthcare commonly spend AED 20,000–50,000+/month. The right budget depends on your industry\'s average CPC, conversion rates, and business goals. We always start with a cost-per-acquisition analysis so your budget is determined by target ROI, not guesswork.</p>'),
('696', '15', '_service_faqs_0_answer', 'field_faq_a'),
('697', '15', 'service_faqs_1_question', 'What is ROAS and what should I target for my UAE campaign?'),
('698', '15', '_service_faqs_1_question', 'field_faq_q'),
('699', '15', 'service_faqs_1_answer', '<p>ROAS (Return on Ad Spend) is the revenue earned for every dirham spent. A ROAS of 4x means you earn AED 4 for every AED 1 spent. For UAE ecommerce, a healthy ROAS is typically 3–8x depending on margins. For lead generation, we track Cost Per Lead and Cost Per Acquisition. We set targets based on your actual profit margins to ensure campaigns are genuinely profitable.</p>'),
('700', '15', '_service_faqs_1_answer', 'field_faq_a'),
('701', '15', 'service_faqs_2_question', 'How long does it take for Google Ads to deliver results?'),
('702', '15', '_service_faqs_2_question', 'field_faq_q'),
('703', '15', 'service_faqs_2_answer', '<p>Google Ads delivers results from day one — ads appear in search results as soon as campaigns go live. Smart Bidding algorithms need a 2–4 week learning period to optimise towards your conversion goals. By weeks 4–8, campaigns typically operate at target efficiency. Full optimisation with statistically significant data usually takes 60–90 days.</p>'),
('704', '15', '_service_faqs_2_answer', 'field_faq_a'),
('705', '15', 'service_faqs_3_question', 'Do you manage Meta Ads as well as Google Ads?'),
('706', '15', '_service_faqs_3_question', 'field_faq_q'),
('707', '15', 'service_faqs_3_answer', '<p>Yes. We manage full-funnel paid media across Google Ads (Search, Display, Shopping, Performance Max, YouTube), Meta Ads (Facebook and Instagram), LinkedIn Ads, TikTok Ads, and Snapchat Ads. For UAE businesses, we recommend a Google Ads-first strategy for high-intent searches combined with Meta Ads for brand awareness and remarketing.</p>'),
('708', '15', '_service_faqs_3_answer', 'field_faq_a'),
('709', '15', 'service_faqs_4_question', 'What is remarketing and why is it important for UAE businesses?'),
('710', '15', '_service_faqs_4_question', 'field_faq_q'),
('711', '15', 'service_faqs_4_answer', '<p>Remarketing shows targeted ads to people who visited your website but didn\'t convert. Studies show only 2–4% of visitors convert on their first visit. Remarketing keeps your brand visible to the remaining 96–98% — significantly increasing conversion rates at a fraction of the cost of acquiring new clicks. For UAE businesses with high-value products or services, remarketing is often the highest-ROAS channel in the entire marketing mix.</p>'),
('712', '15', '_service_faqs_4_answer', 'field_faq_a'),
('713', '15', 'service_faqs_5_question', 'What is the difference between Search Ads and Performance Max?'),
('714', '15', '_service_faqs_5_question', 'field_faq_q'),
('715', '15', 'service_faqs_5_answer', '<p>Search Ads target specific keywords users are actively searching — ideal for high-intent bottom-of-funnel capture. Performance Max uses Google\'s AI to serve ads across all Google properties simultaneously based on your conversion goals. We typically recommend running both: Search for intent capture and Performance Max for broad market coverage.</p>'),
('716', '15', '_service_faqs_5_answer', 'field_faq_a'),
('717', '15', 'service_faqs_6_question', 'How do you prevent wasted ad spend?'),
('718', '15', '_service_faqs_6_question', 'field_faq_q'),
('719', '15', 'service_faqs_6_answer', '<p>We prevent waste through comprehensive negative keyword lists (500–2,000+ negatives from day one), precise audience targeting, weekly search term analysis, geographic bid adjustments, device and time-of-day scheduling, and strict match type discipline. Clients from self-managed campaigns see a 30–50% reduction in wasted spend within the first 30 days while maintaining conversion volume.</p>'),
('720', '15', '_service_faqs_6_answer', 'field_faq_a'),
('721', '15', 'service_faqs_7_question', 'Can PPC work alongside SEO, or should I choose one?'),
('722', '15', '_service_faqs_7_question', 'field_faq_q'),
('723', '15', 'service_faqs_7_answer', '<p>PPC and <a href=\"/services/search-engine-optimization\">SEO</a> are most powerful together. PPC delivers immediate visibility while SEO builds long-term organic authority. As SEO rankings improve, you can reduce PPC spend on keywords where you already rank organically. PPC data also provides invaluable keyword insights that inform your SEO content strategy.</p>'),
('724', '15', '_service_faqs_7_answer', 'field_faq_a'),
('725', '15', 'service_faqs_8_question', 'Do you offer Google Shopping Ads for UAE ecommerce?'),
('726', '15', '_service_faqs_8_question', 'field_faq_q'),
('727', '15', 'service_faqs_8_answer', '<p>Yes. Google Shopping (now part of Performance Max) is one of the highest-ROAS channels for UAE ecommerce. We handle complete Merchant Centre setup, product feed optimisation, custom labels, competitive bidding strategies, and PMax asset creation. Our ecommerce PPC campaigns have delivered 4–10x ROAS for clients in fashion, electronics, home, and beauty categories.</p>'),
('728', '15', '_service_faqs_8_answer', 'field_faq_a'),
('729', '15', 'service_faqs_9_question', 'What reports will I receive on my PPC campaigns?'),
('730', '15', '_service_faqs_9_question', 'field_faq_q'),
('731', '15', 'service_faqs_9_answer', '<p>Weekly performance snapshots covering spend, clicks, conversions, CPA, and ROAS. A comprehensive monthly report details campaign-level performance, ad group analysis, search term insights, competitor auction data, and strategic recommendations. You also have access to a live Looker Studio dashboard showing real-time campaign data 24/7.</p>'),
('732', '15', '_service_faqs_9_answer', 'field_faq_a'),
