('1288', '15', 'svc_benefits', 'a:10:{i:0;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:77:\"Immediate first-page visibility from day one, no waiting for organic rankings\";}i:1;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:80:\"Precision audience targeting by location, device, time, demographics, and intent\";}i:2;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:82:\"Full Google Ads account audit identifying wasted spend and quick-win optimisations\";}i:3;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:68:\"Conversion-focused landing page strategy to maximise ad spend return\";}i:4;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:73:\"Smart Bidding with AI-powered automated strategies tailored to your goals\";}i:5;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:80:\"Remarketing campaigns re-engaging website visitors across Google Display Network\";}i:6;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:75:\"Competitive conquest campaigns targeting competitor brand keywords in Dubai\";}i:7;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:67:\"Shopping and Performance Max campaigns for UAE ecommerce businesses\";}i:8;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:74:\"Meta Ads, LinkedIn Ads, and TikTok Ads management for full-funnel coverage\";}i:9;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:72:\"Weekly optimisation cycles with transparent revenue-attributed reporting\";}}'),
('1289', '15', 'svc_process', 'a:7:{i:0;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:35:\"Account Audit & Competitor Research\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:199:\"We audit your existing Google Ads account to identify wasted spend, missing keywords, poor Quality Scores, and immediate improvement opportunities, or analyse competitor strategies if starting fresh.\";}i:1;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:29:\"Campaign Strategy & Structure\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:176:\"We architect a clean, logical campaign structure segmented by service, product, location, and intent, ensuring Google rewards your campaigns with lower CPCs and better Ad Rank.\";}i:2;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:33:\"Keyword Research & Negative Lists\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:189:\"Comprehensive keyword research across all match types, combined with exhaustive negative keyword lists, ensures your budget reaches genuine buyers, not irrelevant searches that drain spend.\";}i:3;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:31:\"Ad Copy & Landing Page Creation\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:192:\"Our copywriters create compelling, high-CTR ad copy with strong USPs and clear calls-to-action. We build or optimise conversion-focused landing pages that turn clicks into enquiries and sales.\";}i:4;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:32:\"Bid Strategy & Budget Allocation\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:179:\"We configure Smart Bidding strategies, Target CPA, Target ROAS, or Maximise Conversions, calibrated to your specific goals and historical data for optimal efficiency from day one.\";}i:5;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:23:\"Continuous Optimisation\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:181:\"Weekly optimisation cycles adjust bids, pause underperforming ads, test new copy variations, expand keyword lists, and refine audience targeting to continuously improve performance.\";}i:6;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:29:\"Reporting & Strategic Reviews\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:199:\"Weekly performance snapshots and monthly strategy reports detail every metric, impressions, clicks, conversions, CPA, ROAS, and revenue. Quarterly reviews align campaign strategy with business goals.\";}}'),
('1290', '15', 'svc_faqs', 'a:10:{i:0;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:53:\"How much should a Dubai business spend on Google Ads?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:409:\"<p>A minimum viable budget for competitive UAE keywords is typically AED 5,000 to 10,000 per month in ad spend. Highly competitive sectors like real estate, legal, or healthcare commonly spend AED 20,000 to 50,000 or more per month. The right budget depends on your industry CPC, conversion rates, and goals. We always start with a cost-per-acquisition analysis so your budget is determined by target ROI.</p>\";}i:1;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:58:\"What is ROAS and what should I target for my UAE campaign?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:334:\"<p>ROAS (Return on Ad Spend) is the revenue earned for every dirham spent. A ROAS of 4x means you earn AED 4 for every AED 1 spent. For UAE ecommerce, a healthy ROAS is typically 3 to 8x depending on margins. For lead generation, we track Cost Per Lead and Cost Per Acquisition. We set targets based on your actual profit margins.</p>\";}i:2;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:56:\"How long does it take for Google Ads to deliver results?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:301:\"<p>Google Ads delivers results from day one. Smart Bidding algorithms need a 2 to 4 week learning period to optimise towards your conversion goals. By weeks 4 to 8, campaigns typically operate at target efficiency. Full optimisation with statistically significant data usually takes 60 to 90 days.</p>\";}i:3;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:45:\"Do you manage Meta Ads as well as Google Ads?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:327:\"<p>Yes. We manage full-funnel paid media across Google Ads (Search, Display, Shopping, Performance Max, YouTube), Meta Ads (Facebook and Instagram), LinkedIn Ads, TikTok Ads, and Snapchat Ads. For UAE businesses, we recommend Google Ads first for high-intent searches combined with Meta for brand awareness and remarketing.</p>\";}i:4;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:63:\"What is remarketing and why is it important for UAE businesses?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:389:\"<p>Remarketing shows targeted ads to people who visited your website but did not convert. Only 2 to 4% of visitors convert on their first visit. Remarketing keeps your brand visible to the remaining 96 to 98% as they browse other sites. For UAE businesses with high-value products or long consideration cycles, remarketing is often the highest-ROAS channel in the entire marketing mix.</p>\";}i:5;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:62:\"What is the difference between Search Ads and Performance Max?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:319:\"<p>Search Ads target specific keywords users are actively searching, ideal for high-intent bottom-of-funnel capture. Performance Max uses Google AI to serve ads across all Google properties simultaneously. We typically recommend running both: Search for intent capture and Performance Max for broad market coverage.</p>\";}i:6;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:35:\"How do you prevent wasted ad spend?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:378:\"<p>We prevent waste through comprehensive negative keyword lists with 500 to 2,000 negatives from day one, precise audience targeting, weekly search term analysis, geographic bid adjustments, device and time-of-day scheduling, and strict match type discipline. Clients from self-managed campaigns typically see a 30 to 50% reduction in wasted spend within the first 30 days.</p>\";}i:7;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:51:\"Can PPC work alongside SEO, or should I choose one?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:350:\"<p>PPC and <a href=\"/services/search-engine-optimization\">SEO</a> are most powerful together. PPC delivers immediate visibility while SEO builds long-term organic authority. As SEO rankings improve, you can reduce PPC spend on organically ranking keywords. PPC data also provides invaluable keyword insights that inform your SEO content strategy.</p>\";}i:8;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:51:\"Do you offer Google Shopping Ads for UAE ecommerce?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:347:\"<p>Yes. Google Shopping is one of the highest-ROAS channels for UAE ecommerce. We handle complete Merchant Centre setup, product feed optimisation, custom labels, competitive bidding, and PMax asset creation. Our ecommerce PPC campaigns have delivered 4 to 10x ROAS for clients across fashion, electronics, home, and beauty sectors in the UAE.</p>\";}i:9;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:48:\"What reports will I receive on my PPC campaigns?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:322:\"<p>Weekly performance snapshots covering spend, clicks, conversions, CPA, and ROAS. A comprehensive monthly report details campaign-level performance, ad group analysis, search term insights, competitor auction data, and strategic recommendations, plus a live Looker Studio dashboard with real-time campaign data 24/7.</p>\";}}'),
('1291', '15', 'svc_technologies', 'a:10:{i:0;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:10:\"Google Ads\";}i:1;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:16:\"Meta Ads Manager\";}i:2;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:18:\"Google Analytics 4\";}i:3;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:22:\"Google Merchant Centre\";}i:4;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:13:\"Looker Studio\";}i:5;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:7:\"SEMrush\";}i:6;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:25:\"LinkedIn Campaign Manager\";}i:7;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:18:\"TikTok Ads Manager\";}i:8;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:18:\"Google Tag Manager\";}i:9;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:7:\"Optmyzr\";}}'),
('1292', '15', 'svc_related', 'a:2:{i:0;i:13;i:1;i:16;}'),
('1293', '14', 'svc_benefits', 'a:10:{i:0;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:67:\"Appear in Google AI Overviews for your most valuable search queries\";}i:1;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:78:\"Get cited by ChatGPT, Perplexity, Claude, and Bing Copilot as a trusted source\";}i:2;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:71:\"Entity-based SEO building brand knowledge graph presence across the web\";}i:3;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:75:\"Structured data and schema markup optimised for AI-readable content formats\";}i:4;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:74:\"Comprehensive E-E-A-T strategy building expertise signals Google AI trusts\";}i:5;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:77:\"Featured snippet and People Also Ask box optimisation for AI content sourcing\";}i:6;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:75:\"Conversational keyword strategy matching natural language AI query patterns\";}i:7;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:70:\"Brand mention monitoring and PR strategy to amplify citation authority\";}i:8;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:73:\"Voice search optimisation for smart speakers and AI assistants in the UAE\";}i:9;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:77:\"Monthly AI search visibility tracking measuring AIO appearances and citations\";}}');

INSERT INTO `wp_postmeta` (`meta_id`, `post_id`, `meta_key`, `meta_value`) VALUES
('1294', '14', 'svc_process', 'a:7:{i:0;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:28:\"AI Search Landscape Analysis\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:196:\"We audit which AI platforms generate traffic in your industry, which competitor content is being cited, and what content characteristics AI systems reward, giving us a precise optimisation target.\";}i:1;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:30:\"Entity & Knowledge Graph Audit\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:189:\"We assess your brand entity presence across Google Knowledge Panel, Wikidata, LinkedIn, and major publications, then identify the gaps preventing AI systems from recognising your authority.\";}i:2;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:29:\"Content Architecture Redesign\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:201:\"We restructure key pages with AI-friendly content formats: clear definitions, numbered lists, comparison tables, FAQ sections, and expert author signals that AI systems preferentially extract and cite.\";}i:3;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:24:\"Schema & Structured Data\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:200:\"Comprehensive schema markup implementation covering FAQPage, HowTo, Article, Person, Organization, Service, and LocalBusiness makes your content machine-readable for AI systems and earns rich results.\";}i:4;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:25:\"Authority Signal Building\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:198:\"Digital PR campaigns, expert commentary placements, podcast appearances, and authoritative publication features build the external citation network that AI models use to assess your trustworthiness.\";}i:5;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:31:\"Conversational Content Creation\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:198:\"We create content optimised for conversational, natural language queries, the style predominantly used with AI assistants, including comprehensive FAQ content, how-to guides, and comparison content.\";}i:6;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:15:\"Monitor & Adapt\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:194:\"Monthly tracking of AI Overview appearances, competitor citation rates, and brand mention velocity across AI platforms. We continuously adapt strategy as the AI search landscape evolves rapidly.\";}}'),
('1295', '14', 'svc_faqs', 'a:10:{i:0;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:56:\"What is Google AI Overviews and how do I appear in them?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:422:\"<p>Google AI Overviews are AI-generated summaries appearing at the top of search results, synthesising information from multiple web sources. To appear, your content needs to be comprehensive and trusted by Google as authoritative. Key factors are strong E-E-A-T signals, FAQPage and HowTo schema markup, existing first-page rankings for the target query, and a well-established brand entity in Google Knowledge Graph.</p>\";}i:1;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:45:\"What is GEO (Generative Engine Optimisation)?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:386:\"<p>GEO is the discipline of optimising your digital presence to be cited and recommended by AI search engines like ChatGPT, Perplexity, Claude, and Google Gemini. Unlike traditional SEO which focuses on blue-link rankings, GEO focuses on building the authority, trust signals, and content characteristics that cause AI models to cite your business when users ask relevant questions.</p>\";}i:2;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:51:\"Does AI search reduce the value of traditional SEO?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:429:\"<p>AI search complements rather than replaces traditional SEO. Approximately 70% of AI Overview citations come from pages already ranking in the top 10 organic results. However, AI search does reduce click-through rates for queries where AIOs provide complete answers. The smart strategy is to maintain strong <a href=\"/services/search-engine-optimization\">SEO foundations</a> while simultaneously optimising for AI citation.</p>\";}i:3;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:41:\"Which AI platforms should I optimise for?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:441:\"<p>Priority platforms for UAE businesses include Google AI Overviews for the highest traffic volume, Perplexity AI which is fastest growing in B2B research, ChatGPT with Browse and Search for its enormous user base, Bing Copilot integrated into Microsoft 365, and Google Gemini. Optimising for one tends to improve visibility across all, since every AI system values comprehensive content, verified expertise, and strong brand authority.</p>\";}i:4;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:56:\"What is entity SEO and why does it matter for AI search?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:391:\"<p>Entities are the real-world people, organisations, places, and concepts that knowledge graphs like Google track. AI systems rely heavily on entity relationships. Entity SEO builds your brand presence across structured data sources, Knowledge Graph entries, Wikidata, LinkedIn, major directories, and citation networks. Strong entity presence is increasingly critical to AI visibility.</p>\";}i:5;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:53:\"How do you measure success in AI search optimisation?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:369:\"<p>We track frequency of Google AIO appearances for target queries, brand mention velocity on AI platforms, Knowledge Panel presence and completeness, featured snippet ownership rates, Share of Voice in AI-generated responses versus competitors, and referral traffic from AI platforms like Perplexity. We use specialised monitoring tools plus manual query sampling.</p>\";}i:6;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:66:\"Do I need separate Arabic content for AI search for UAE audiences?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:360:\"<p>Yes. Arabic-language AI queries require Arabic-language authoritative content to be cited. UAE consumers increasingly use voice search and AI assistants in Arabic for local service queries. We create bilingual AI-optimised content in both English and Arabic with proper hreflang implementation and outreach to Arabic-language authoritative publications.</p>\";}i:7;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:45:\"How is AI SEO different from traditional SEO?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:426:\"<p>Traditional SEO optimises for algorithmic ranking signals including backlinks, keywords, and technical factors. AI SEO optimises for trustworthiness and citation-worthiness, covering comprehensiveness, factual accuracy, expert authorship, brand authority, and structured data. AI systems prefer definitional content, structured answers, numbered processes, and FAQ formats that can be cleanly extracted and synthesised.</p>\";}i:8;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:53:\"What is schema markup and how does it help AI search?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:396:\"<p>Schema markup is structured data in JSON-LD format added to your HTML that explicitly describes your content to search engines and AI systems. FAQPage schema marks your content as Q and A pairs ideal for AIO sourcing. HowTo schema marks step-by-step processes. Organization and LocalBusiness schemas verify your brand identity and Dubai location. AI systems consume schema markup directly.</p>\";}i:9;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:36:\"How quickly can AI SEO show results?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:463:\"<p>Quick wins such as appearing in featured snippets or implementing FAQPage schema can produce visible results within 4 to 8 weeks. Building comprehensive entity authority and consistent AIO appearances is a 3 to 6 month process. Most UAE businesses have not yet begun optimising for AI search, meaning early movers can establish dominant visibility before the market catches up. <a href=\"/contact\">Contact us</a> to assess your current AI search visibility.</p>\";}}'),
('1296', '14', 'svc_technologies', 'a:10:{i:0;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:18:\"Google Search Labs\";}i:1;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:13:\"Perplexity AI\";}i:2;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:14:\"ChatGPT Search\";}i:3;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:10:\"Schema.org\";}i:4;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:21:\"Google Search Console\";}i:5;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:6:\"Ahrefs\";}i:6;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:7:\"Brand24\";}i:7;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:10:\"Surfer SEO\";}i:8;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:26:\"Google Knowledge Graph API\";}i:9;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:14:\"Screaming Frog\";}}'),
('1297', '14', 'svc_related', 'a:2:{i:0;i:13;i:1;i:15;}'),
('1298', '16', 'svc_benefits', 'a:10:{i:0;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:75:\"Full-service management across Instagram, LinkedIn, TikTok, Facebook, and X\";}i:1;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:80:\"Dubai-focused content strategy aligned with UAE culture, trends, and seasonality\";}i:2;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:73:\"Professional Arabic and English content creation by bilingual specialists\";}i:3;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:67:\"Community management responding to comments, DMs, and reviews daily\";}i:4;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:78:\"Influencer marketing campaigns connecting your brand with UAE content creators\";}i:5;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:83:\"Paid social advertising including Meta Ads, LinkedIn Ads, and TikTok Ads management\";}i:6;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:74:\"30-day content calendar with advance planning and client approval workflow\";}i:7;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:74:\"Brand voice development ensuring consistent messaging across all platforms\";}i:8;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:80:\"Competitor social analysis identifying content gaps and engagement opportunities\";}i:9;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:80:\"Monthly analytics reports tracking reach, engagement, follower growth, and leads\";}}'),
('1299', '16', 'svc_process', 'a:7:{i:0;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:22:\"Brand & Audience Audit\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:211:\"We analyse your current social media presence, audience demographics, content performance, competitor benchmarks, and UAE market positioning to establish a baseline and identify the biggest growth opportunities.\";}i:1;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:29:\"Strategy & Platform Selection\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:218:\"Not every platform deserves equal investment. We select the right mix, Instagram for visual brands, LinkedIn for B2B, TikTok for reach, X for real-time engagement, based on where your target audience spends their time.\";}i:2;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:26:\"Content Pillars & Calendar\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:212:\"We develop 4 to 6 content pillars aligned with your brand and audience needs, then build a 30-day content calendar mixing educational, entertaining, and promotional content at optimal frequency for each platform.\";}i:3;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:29:\"Content Creation & Production\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:195:\"Our creative team produces platform-native content including Reels, Stories, carousels, infographics, videos, and written posts in both English and Arabic, tailored to UAE social media audiences.\";}i:4;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:33:\"Publishing & Community Management\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:195:\"We publish at optimal times for UAE audiences, monitor all comments and DMs, respond to followers, and manage any reputation issues in real time, maintaining an active and engaged brand presence.\";}i:5;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:25:\"Paid Social Amplification\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:186:\"Organic reach is boosted strategically with targeted paid promotion on high-performing posts, plus dedicated paid social campaigns for product launches, lead generation, and remarketing.\";}i:6;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:29:\"Analytics & Monthly Reporting\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:202:\"Monthly reports cover reach, impressions, engagement rate, follower growth, website traffic from social, lead generation, and paid social ROAS. We continuously optimise content strategy using this data.\";}}'),
('1300', '16', 'svc_faqs', 'a:10:{i:0;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:62:\"Which social media platforms should a Dubai business focus on?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:420:\"<p>Instagram with 88% UAE penetration is essential for consumer brands, hospitality, and retail. LinkedIn is the priority for B2B companies and professional services. TikTok is critical for reaching 18 to 35 year olds and brands wanting high organic reach. YouTube is ideal for educational content. We recommend starting with 2 to 3 platforms done exceptionally well rather than spreading thinly across all channels.</p>\";}i:1;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:70:\"How many posts per week do I need for effective social media in Dubai?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:341:\"<p>For Instagram: 4 to 7 feed posts per week including Reels, carousels, and static plus daily Stories. For LinkedIn: 3 to 5 posts per week. For TikTok: 5 to 7 short videos per week. Consistency matters more than volume. A reliable 4-post-per-week strategy with quality content will always outperform inconsistent high-frequency posting.</p>\";}i:2;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:50:\"Do you create Arabic content for UAE social media?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:403:\"<p>Yes. Our bilingual content team creates authentic Arabic and English content, not machine-translated copy. Arabic content is essential for reaching Emirati and Arab expat audiences. Arabic Reels often achieve higher organic reach within GCC audiences. We create culturally appropriate content that respects Arabic social media norms and avoids translation errors that can damage brand perception.</p>\";}i:3;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:60:\"What is influencer marketing and is it effective in the UAE?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:438:\"<p>UAE influencer marketing is one of the highest-ROI social channels available, with engagement rates 3 to 5 times global averages. Micro-influencers with 10,000 to 100,000 followers typically deliver higher engagement and conversion rates than mega-influencers at a fraction of the cost. We manage end-to-end campaigns covering talent identification, contract negotiation, brief creation, content approval, and performance tracking.</p>\";}i:4;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:57:\"How do you measure social media ROI for a Dubai business?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:400:\"<p>Social media ROI measurement depends on objectives. For brand awareness: reach, impressions, follower growth, and Share of Voice. For engagement: engagement rate, saves, and shares. For lead generation: click-through rates, form completions, and cost per lead. For ecommerce: direct social revenue through UTM-tagged links and Meta Pixel attribution. We combine these into a monthly dashboard.</p>\";}i:5;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:51:\"What content performs best on Instagram in the UAE?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:392:\"<p>Instagram Reels consistently deliver the highest organic reach in the UAE. Educational how-to content performs strongly. Behind-the-scenes and human interest content generates high engagement. Dubai lifestyle and aspirational content resonates well with the UAE upwardly mobile demographic. Stories with interactive elements drive engagement and keep accounts algorithmically favoured.</p>\";}i:6;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:61:\"Can social media marketing generate leads and sales directly?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:464:\"<p>Absolutely. Instagram and Facebook Lead Ads allow users to submit contact details without leaving the platform, which is excellent for booking requests and service enquiries. LinkedIn Lead Gen Forms are particularly effective for B2B. We combine organic lead nurturing with targeted paid social campaigns to deliver a measurable pipeline. Pair social with our <a href=\"/services/ppc-management\">PPC management</a> for full-funnel digital marketing coverage.</p>\";}i:7;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:44:\"What is TikTok potential for UAE businesses?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:416:\"<p>TikTok UAE has one of the highest per-capita engagement rates globally. For consumer brands targeting 18 to 40 year olds, TikTok offers extraordinary organic reach. A single well-crafted video can reach tens of thousands of UAE users without any paid promotion. The algorithm favours genuine content quality over follower count, creating a level playing field for brands willing to invest in creative content.</p>\";}i:8;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:74:\"Do you manage social media for multiple locations or franchise businesses?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:353:\"<p>Yes. We manage multi-location social media for brands across Dubai, Abu Dhabi, Sharjah, and other emirates, as well as franchise businesses with individual location accounts. We create master content frameworks localised for each location while maintaining brand consistency, with location-specific community management and paid social targeting.</p>\";}i:9;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:65:\"How long does it take to see results from social media marketing?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:369:\"<p>Follower growth and engagement improvements are typically visible within 30 to 60 days with consistent quality content. Brand awareness lift is usually apparent within the first month. Lead generation typically emerges within 60 to 90 days. Paid social campaigns can generate leads from day one. <a href=\"/contact\">Get in touch</a> for a free social media audit.</p>\";}}'),
('1301', '16', 'svc_technologies', 'a:10:{i:0;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:19:\"Meta Business Suite\";}i:1;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:9:\"Hootsuite\";}i:2;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:13:\"Sprout Social\";}i:3;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:9:\"Canva Pro\";}i:4;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:18:\"Adobe Premiere Pro\";}i:5;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:6:\"CapCut\";}i:6;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:25:\"LinkedIn Campaign Manager\";}i:7;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:18:\"TikTok Ads Manager\";}i:8;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:5:\"Later\";}i:9;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:8:\"BuzzSumo\";}}'),
('1302', '16', 'svc_related', 'a:2:{i:0;i:15;i:1;i:17;}'),
('1303', '17', 'svc_benefits', 'a:10:{i:0;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:81:\"Bespoke designs built to reflect your brand identity and Dubai market positioning\";}i:1;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:79:\"Mobile-first approach designed for the 85%+ of UAE users browsing on smartphone\";}i:2;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:84:\"Arabic and English bilingual layouts with proper RTL support and cultural adaptation\";}i:3;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:69:\"Conversion Rate Optimisation built into every page layout and element\";}i:4;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:78:\"Core Web Vitals optimisation ensuring fast, smooth page experience from launch\";}i:5;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:72:\"SEO-ready architecture with clean code, semantic HTML, and schema markup\";}i:6;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:76:\"CMS-powered design, edit any page, any time through a simple admin dashboard\";}i:7;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:62:\"Brand identity and visual language creation for new businesses\";}i:8;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:74:\"Landing page design optimised for PPC campaigns and paid media performance\";}i:9;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:74:\"Post-launch A/B testing to continuously improve conversion rates over time\";}}'),
('1304', '17', 'svc_process', 'a:7:{i:0;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:26:\"Discovery & Brand Workshop\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:227:\"We run a structured discovery session to understand your business goals, target UAE audience, competitive positioning, brand values, and the specific actions you want website visitors to take. This shapes every design decision.\";}i:1;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:25:\"UX Research & Wireframing\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:196:\"Before design, we map the optimal user journey from arrival to conversion. Wireframes define the information architecture, page layouts, and conversion pathways before any visual element is added.\";}i:2;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:28:\"Visual Design & Brand System\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:247:\"Our designers create a bespoke visual design that expresses your brand personality, appeals to your target UAE audience, and differentiates you from competitors. You receive a complete design system with colours, typography, and component library.\";}i:3;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:25:\"Prototype & Client Review\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:208:\"We build interactive Figma prototypes of all key pages so you can experience the design before any code is written. Multiple revision rounds ensure the final design is exactly right before development begins.\";}i:4;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:23:\"Development & CMS Build\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:190:\"Designs are built with clean semantic HTML, responsive across all devices, and integrated with WordPress CMS that gives your team full control to update content without developer assistance.\";}i:5;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:26:\"Quality Assurance & Launch\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:217:\"Rigorous testing across devices, browsers, screen sizes, and connection speeds. Every link, form, animation, and interactive element is checked before launch. Go-live is coordinated to minimise any SEO ranking impact.\";}i:6;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:24:\"Post-Launch Optimisation\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:212:\"Website launch is the beginning, not the end. We monitor Core Web Vitals, heatmaps, session recordings, and conversion data post-launch to identify optimisation opportunities and continuously improve performance.\";}}'),
('1305', '17', 'svc_faqs', 'a:10:{i:0;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:38:\"How much does a website cost in Dubai?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:372:\"<p>Professional business website design in Dubai ranges from AED 5,000 to 15,000 for a standard SME site to AED 20,000 to 80,000 or more for complex enterprise or ecommerce projects. Cost depends on page count, design complexity, custom functionality, and Arabic language support. We provide detailed, itemised proposals after a free consultation with no hidden costs.</p>\";}i:1;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:61:\"How long does it take to design and build a website in Dubai?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:311:\"<p>A standard business website of 5 to 15 pages typically takes 6 to 10 weeks from kick-off to launch. Ecommerce websites and complex custom builds may take 12 to 20 weeks. The timeline depends heavily on content readiness. Clients who have their content prepared benefit from significantly faster delivery.</p>\";}i:2;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:47:\"Do you design Arabic websites with RTL support?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:379:\"<p>Yes. Bilingual Arabic-English websites are a core speciality. Arabic web design requires genuine RTL layout implementation, not simply mirroring an English design. We design Arabic layouts natively, select appropriate Arabic typefaces, adapt visual compositions for Arabic reading patterns, and ensure the CMS allows editors to manage both language versions independently.</p>\";}i:3;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:62:\"What is a conversion-optimised website and why does it matter?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:411:\"<p>A conversion-optimised website is designed to turn visitors into enquiries, leads, or sales. This means clear value propositions above the fold, strategic CTA placement, trust signals at key decision points, frictionless forms, fast loading speeds, and mobile usability that matches how UAE users actually browse. A conversion-optimised website can double or triple leads generated from the same traffic.</p>\";}i:4;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:69:\"What is Core Web Vitals and why is it important for my Dubai website?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:415:\"<p>Core Web Vitals are Google user experience metrics measuring Largest Contentful Paint for loading speed, Interaction to Next Paint for responsiveness, and Cumulative Layout Shift for visual stability. These are direct Google ranking factors. In the UAE mobile-first market, Core Web Vitals also directly impact bounce rates and conversion rates. All our websites pass Core Web Vitals thresholds from day one.</p>\";}i:5;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:54:\"Will my website be easy to update without a developer?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:394:\"<p>Absolutely. Every website we build runs on WordPress CMS that gives your team complete control to update text, images, blog posts, team pages, service descriptions, and more through a simple visual interface with no coding required. We provide a personalised training session and written documentation. For clients who prefer not to manage updates, we offer monthly maintenance packages.</p>\";}i:6;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:53:\"Is my website built to rank on Google from the start?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:447:\"<p>Yes. SEO-readiness is built into every project from the architecture stage with clean semantic HTML, proper heading hierarchy, optimised page titles and meta descriptions, XML sitemap configuration, schema markup, compressed WebP images with descriptive alt text, canonical tags, and structured internal linking. We integrate our <a href=\"/services/search-engine-optimization\">SEO service</a> with new builds for immediate ranking momentum.</p>\";}i:7;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:53:\"Do you design landing pages for Google Ads campaigns?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:417:\"<p>Yes. Conversion-focused landing pages are among our most valuable deliverables. A purpose-built landing page with a single clear offer, compelling headline, trust signals, and frictionless form can double or triple conversion rates versus sending <a href=\"/services/ppc-management\">PPC</a> traffic to a standard website page. We build, test, and continuously optimise landing pages to maximise advertising ROI.</p>\";}i:8;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:39:\"What happens after my website launches?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:325:\"<p>We provide 30 days of post-launch support at no charge covering bug fixes, browser compatibility issues, and minor content adjustments. After 30 days, ongoing support is available through maintenance packages covering security updates, WordPress and plugin updates, performance monitoring, and monthly content updates.</p>\";}i:9;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:67:\"Can you redesign my existing website while keeping my SEO rankings?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:439:\"<p>Yes. SEO preservation during redesign is something we take extremely seriously. A poorly managed migration can cause significant ranking drops. Our process includes comprehensive URL audit and redirect mapping, preserving all ranking URLs with 301 redirects, migrating all meta data, and monitoring rankings closely for 3 months post-launch. <a href=\"/contact\">Contact us</a> for a migration audit before committing to any redesign.</p>\";}}'),
('1306', '17', 'svc_technologies', 'a:10:{i:0;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:5:\"Figma\";}i:1;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:9:\"WordPress\";}i:2;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:13:\"Elementor Pro\";}i:3;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:20:\"Adobe Creative Suite\";}i:4;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:7:\"Webflow\";}i:5;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:5:\"React\";}i:6;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:25:\"Google PageSpeed Insights\";}i:7;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:6:\"Hotjar\";}i:8;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:8:\"GTmetrix\";}i:9;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:18:\"Google Tag Manager\";}}'),
('1307', '17', 'svc_related', 'a:2:{i:0;i:18;i:1;i:13;}'),
('1308', '18', 'svc_benefits', 'a:10:{i:0;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:75:\"Custom WordPress development with bespoke themes, plugins, and integrations\";}i:1;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:83:\"WooCommerce ecommerce development for UAE online stores with local payment gateways\";}i:2;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:79:\"React and Next.js application development for dynamic, app-like web experiences\";}i:3;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:73:\"Arabic language support with full RTL implementation across all platforms\";}i:4;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:89:\"UAE payment gateway integration covering PayFort, Telr, Network International, and Stripe\";}i:5;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:88:\"REST API development and third-party API integration for CRM, ERP, payment, and shipping\";}i:6;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:79:\"Performance-first development with Core Web Vitals optimised from initial build\";}i:7;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:85:\"Security hardening, SSL, and GDPR and PDPL compliance for UAE regulatory requirements\";}i:8;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:69:\"Scalable hosting on Dubai-based or UAE-compliant cloud infrastructure\";}i:9;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:77:\"Ongoing maintenance, updates, and 24/7 monitoring for production applications\";}}'),
('1309', '18', 'svc_process', 'a:7:{i:0;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:34:\"Technical Discovery & Architecture\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:195:\"We map your technical requirements, integration points, scalability needs, and existing infrastructure to architect a solution that solves today problems without creating tomorrow technical debt.\";}i:1;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:20:\"Technology Selection\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:251:\"We recommend the right stack based on your requirements: WordPress for CMS flexibility, WooCommerce for ecommerce, React or Next.js for complex applications, or custom PHP and Node.js for unique needs. No one-size-fits-all approach in web development.\";}i:2;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:19:\"Development Sprints\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:199:\"Agile development in 2-week sprints with regular demos ensures you see progress continuously, can provide feedback early, and are never surprised at delivery. All code is version-controlled with Git.\";}i:3;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:22:\"Integration & API Work\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:198:\"We integrate your website with external systems your business depends on, including CRMs, ERPs, payment gateways, shipping providers, accounting systems, marketing automation tools, and custom APIs.\";}i:4;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:17:\"Quality Assurance\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:262:\"Comprehensive testing across browsers, devices, and screen sizes. Performance testing against Core Web Vitals benchmarks. Security audits. Load testing for high-traffic scenarios. Accessibility WCAG 2.1 AA verification. Nothing ships until it passes every check.\";}i:5;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:19:\"Deployment & Launch\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:226:\"Staged deployment from development to staging to production ensures zero-downtime launches. We configure CDN, caching, SSL, server optimisation, and monitoring before go-live. Launch is coordinated for minimal business impact.\";}i:6;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:32:\"Support & Continuous Development\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:218:\"Post-launch support packages range from basic monitoring and updates to dedicated monthly development retainers. We become your long-term technology partner, continuously improving your platform as your business grows.\";}}'),
('1310', '18', 'svc_faqs', 'a:10:{i:0;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:55:\"Should my Dubai business use WordPress or a custom CMS?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:444:\"<p>WordPress powers 43% of the world websites and is our recommended solution for the majority of Dubai business websites. It offers unmatched CMS flexibility, the largest plugin ecosystem, excellent SEO capabilities, strong security when properly maintained, and lower long-term costs than custom CMS development. Custom CMS makes sense only when you have very specific workflow requirements WordPress genuinely cannot meet, which is rare.</p>\";}i:1;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:59:\"What UAE payment gateways can you integrate into a website?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:421:\"<p>We integrate all major UAE-compliant payment gateways: PayFort (Amazon Payment Services) the most widely used in the UAE; Telr which is excellent for SME ecommerce; Network International preferred by large enterprises; Stripe with strong developer tooling; and PayPal. We also handle Apple Pay and Google Pay integration, plus tabby and Tamara for BNPL which is increasingly important for UAE ecommerce conversion.</p>\";}i:2;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:66:\"Can you build a website that supports Arabic and English with RTL?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:385:\"<p>Yes. Bilingual Arabic-English web development is a core competency. Full RTL Arabic support requires custom theme development with bidirectional layout support, Arabic font stack implementation, separate Arabic and English admin interfaces in the CMS, hreflang implementation for Google language targeting, and testing across all browsers and devices for both language versions.</p>\";}i:3;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:62:\"How do you ensure a website is fast and meets Core Web Vitals?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:446:\"<p>Performance is engineered from architecture through deployment using server-side rendering for first-paint speed, image optimisation with WebP and lazy loading, code splitting, efficient CSS, CDN implementation, database query optimisation, server-level caching with Redis or Memcached, and HTTP/2 or HTTP/3 protocol. We target LCP under 2.5 seconds, INP under 200 milliseconds, and CLS below 0.1, which are Google Good ranking thresholds.</p>\";}i:4;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:52:\"What is headless WordPress and when should I use it?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:415:\"<p>Headless WordPress separates the CMS backend from the frontend presentation layer, typically React or Next.js, delivering superior performance as pages are served as static HTML via CDN. We recommend headless for high-traffic sites with 100,000 or more monthly visitors or applications requiring app-like interactivity. For most Dubai SMEs, traditional WordPress delivers excellent performance at lower cost.</p>\";}i:5;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:64:\"Can you build a WooCommerce store for my UAE ecommerce business?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:425:\"<p>Yes. WooCommerce handles unlimited products, complex variable products, multiple currencies, UAE tax configuration, Aramex and DHL API integration, all major UAE payment gateways, Arabic language support, and SEO optimisation for product and category pages. We have built WooCommerce stores processing AED 1 million or more in monthly transactions for UAE clients across fashion, electronics, beauty, and food sectors.</p>\";}i:6;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:56:\"How do you handle website security for Dubai businesses?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:403:\"<p>Security implementation includes SSL certificate and HTTPS enforcement, WordPress core, theme, and plugin update management, Web Application Firewall configuration, two-factor authentication, database hardening, file permission hardening, regular malware scanning, and login attempt limiting. For ecommerce sites handling payment data, we implement additional PCI-DSS compliant security measures.</p>\";}i:7;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:51:\"What hosting do you recommend for Dubai businesses?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:426:\"<p>For UAE businesses, we recommend AWS Middle East Region in Bahrain for enterprise and high-traffic sites due to lowest latency for UAE visitors, SiteGround or Kinsta for managed WordPress hosting, and Digital Ocean for custom application hosting. For UAE-based hosting satisfying data residency requirements, we work with Etisalat e-Cloud and du Datamena. We avoid generic shared hosting for business-critical websites.</p>\";}i:8;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:53:\"Do you offer ongoing website maintenance and support?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:458:\"<p>Yes. All clients receive 30 days of post-launch support included. Beyond that, monthly maintenance packages cover WordPress core, theme, and plugin updates, uptime monitoring, weekly automated backups, monthly security scans, Core Web Vitals monitoring, and development hours. Packages start from AED 500 per month for basic monitoring to AED 2,500 per month for comprehensive care. <a href=\"/contact\">Contact us</a> to discuss your maintenance needs.</p>\";}i:9;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:54:\"Can you migrate my existing website to a new platform?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:456:\"<p>Yes. Platform migrations from Squarespace, Wix, or custom CMS to WordPress, or from Shopify to WooCommerce, are regular work. Our migration process includes complete content audit and migration, URL structure preservation with 301 redirect mapping, meta data transfer, image optimisation during migration, and post-migration SEO monitoring to catch any ranking impact immediately. <a href=\"/contact\">Contact us</a> to discuss your migration project.</p>\";}}'),
('1311', '18', 'svc_technologies', 'a:10:{i:0;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:9:\"WordPress\";}i:1;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:11:\"WooCommerce\";}i:2;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:5:\"React\";}i:3;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:7:\"Next.js\";}i:4;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:5:\"PHP 8\";}i:5;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:5:\"MySQL\";}i:6;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:19:\"AWS / Digital Ocean\";}i:7;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:12:\"Git / GitHub\";}i:8;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:8:\"REST API\";}i:9;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:14:\"Cloudflare CDN\";}}'),
