<section class=\"faq-section\">
  <h2>Frequently Asked Questions About AI Search Optimization</h2>

  <div class=\"faq-item\">
    <h3>What is AI Search Optimization and how is it different from regular SEO?</h3>
    <p>AI Search Optimization (covering AEO, GEO, and LLMO) focuses on making your brand appear in answers generated by AI tools like ChatGPT, Google AI Overviews, Perplexity, and Gemini. Regular SEO focuses on ranking in the list of blue links on search engine results pages. AI Search Optimization requires different techniques — structured data, E-E-A-T signals, and conversational content architecture — rather than primarily keyword density and backlink volume.</p>
  </div>

  <div class=\"faq-item\">
    <h3>Does AI Search Optimization replace traditional SEO?</h3>
    <p>No. AI Search Optimization and traditional SEO are complementary disciplines. Traditional SEO captures users who click through organic results; AI Search Optimization captures users who act on AI-generated answers without clicking. Dubai businesses need both to maintain comprehensive search visibility. We integrate both into unified campaigns for maximum coverage.</p>
  </div>

  <div class=\"faq-item\">
    <h3>How long does it take to start appearing in AI answers?</h3>
    <p>Initial improvements in structured data and E-E-A-T signals can influence AI Overviews within 4–8 weeks. Appearing in ChatGPT and Perplexity answers typically requires 3–6 months of sustained optimisation, as LLM training cycles update less frequently than search engine crawls. We provide monthly progress reports so you can track your growing AI visibility throughout the process.</p>
  </div>

  <div class=\"faq-item\">
    <h3>Can you optimize for Arabic-language AI queries?</h3>
    <p>Yes. This is one of our key specialisations for UAE clients. We conduct separate intent mapping for Arabic-language queries, optimise bilingual schema markup, and create or enhance Arabic-language content specifically designed to be cited by AI engines responding to Arabic queries. This is a significant untapped opportunity for most Dubai businesses.</p>
  </div>

  <div class=\"faq-item\">
    <h3>What is E-E-A-T and why does it matter for AI search?</h3>
    <p>E-E-A-T stands for Experience, Expertise, Authoritativeness, and Trustworthiness. Google developed it as a quality evaluation framework, and it is now a core signal used by AI engines — including Google\'s own AI Overviews — to determine which sources are reliable enough to cite. Strong E-E-A-T signals include verified author credentials, editorial standards, external citations, and consistent factual accuracy.</p>
  </div>

  <div class=\"faq-item\">
    <h3>What schema markup types are most important for AI search?</h3>
    <p>The most impactful schema types for AI citation include FAQPage (direct Q&amp;A extraction), HowTo (step-by-step content), Organization and LocalBusiness (brand entity recognition), Article with author markup (E-E-A-T signalling), and Product with Review schema (e-commerce authority). We implement all relevant schema types based on your content type and industry vertical.</p>
  </div>

  <div class=\"faq-item\">
    <h3>How do you track whether my brand appears in AI answers?</h3>
    <p>We conduct systematic bi-weekly citation sweeps using a curated set of target queries across ChatGPT, Perplexity, Google AI Overviews, and Gemini. We document whether your brand is cited, what phrasing is used, which pages are referenced, and where competitors appear instead. This data drives our monthly reporting and informs ongoing optimisation priorities.</p>
  </div>

  <div class=\"faq-item\">
    <h3>Is AI Search Optimization suitable for small and medium businesses in Dubai?</h3>
    <p>Absolutely. In fact, SMEs often have a structural advantage in niche query categories where large generic websites haven\'t focused. A specialist legal firm, a boutique medical clinic, or a niche e-commerce brand can achieve dominant AI citation in their category more quickly than they could ever outrank major platforms in traditional SEO. We offer AI Search Optimization packages scaled for SME budgets.</p>
  </div>

  <div class=\"faq-item\">
    <h3>Do AI Overviews reduce my website traffic?</h3>
    <p>For queries where your site is <em>not</em> cited, AI Overviews can reduce clicks to your website because users get answers without visiting you. However, for queries where your site <em>is</em> cited as a source, AI Overviews can actually increase traffic quality — the users who click through after seeing your brand cited in an AI answer are highly pre-qualified. Our goal is to make you the cited source, not the overlooked alternative.</p>
  </div>

  <div class=\"faq-item\">
    <h3>What is the difference between GEO and AEO?</h3>
    <p>AEO (Answer Engine Optimization) broadly covers optimising for any AI assistant or voice search tool that generates direct answers. GEO (Generative Engine Optimization) specifically refers to appearing in the AI-generated summary blocks on search engines like Google AI Overviews and Bing Copilot. GEO is a subset and specialisation of AEO, focusing on search-engine-integrated AI rather than standalone AI assistants.</p>
  </div>

  <div class=\"faq-item\">
    <h3>How does AI Search Optimization work alongside PPC campaigns?</h3>
    <p>AI Search Optimization and <a href=\"/services/ppc-management/\">PPC advertising</a> serve different parts of the search experience and are highly complementary. PPC captures commercial intent clicks through paid placements; AI Search Optimization builds brand authority and awareness through AI citations that increase branded search volume over time. Many of our Dubai clients run both simultaneously, using PPC data to identify the highest-value query categories to target for AI optimization.</p>
  </div>

  <div class=\"faq-item\">
    <h3>How do I get started with AI Search Optimization for my UAE business?</h3>
    <p>The first step is a free AI Visibility Audit, where we assess your current presence in AI-generated answers and identify your top citation opportunities. <a href=\"/contact/\">Contact our team today</a> to book your audit. We\'ll provide a comprehensive report within five business days, followed by a strategy session where we map out a customised AI Search Optimization roadmap for your business.</p>
  </div>
</section>

