<p>One of the most frequent questions we receive from Dubai business owners is: <em>\"Should I invest in PPC or SEO?\"</em> The honest answer is that both serve different purposes — and the most successful businesses in the UAE use them in tandem. Here\'s a clear breakdown:</p>

