', 'Web Design Services Dubai — Conversion-Optimised Websites', 'Conversion-optimised websites that look exceptional and rank higher. We design for the user experience that drives enquiries, sales, and growth.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'web-design', '', '', '2026-07-29 17:57:50', '2026-07-29 17:57:50', '', '0', 'http://localhost:8000/services/web-design/', '0', 'service', '', '0'),
('18', '0', '2026-07-29 14:08:18', '2026-07-29 14:08:18', '<img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555066931-4365d14bab8c?w=1200&#038;q=80&#038;auto=format&#038;fit=crop\" alt=\"Web development Dubai — WordPress React custom builds UAE\" style=\"width:100%;border-radius:16px;margin:0 0 2rem;aspect-ratio:16/7;object-fit:cover;\" loading=\"lazy\">

<p class=\"service-intro\">Exceptional web design means nothing if the underlying code is slow, insecure, or breaks under real-world conditions. Our web development service builds the technical infrastructure your digital presence demands — clean, performant, secure, and scalable code that performs under load, protects your users\' data, and gives your team the control they need without depending on a developer for routine updates.</p>

<p>We build websites and web applications that combine technical excellence with maintainability. Every project is documented, tested, and handed over with the training your team needs to manage it confidently. We don\'t create dependencies — we build independence.</p>

<h2>Our Web Development Services</h2>

<img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504384308090-c894fdcc538d?w=1100&#038;q=80&#038;auto=format&#038;fit=crop\" alt=\"Custom web development — Dubai development agency\" style=\"width:100%;border-radius:12px;margin:2rem 0;aspect-ratio:16/7;object-fit:cover;\" loading=\"lazy\">

<h3>WordPress Development</h3>

<p>WordPress is our primary platform — and for most business websites, the right choice. We build bespoke WordPress themes (not purchased templates) from scratch, with custom post types, Advanced Custom Fields, and fully flexible content management. Our WordPress builds are fast (Core Web Vitals-optimised from day one), secure (hardened against common attack vectors), and built to be managed by your team without developer dependency.</p>

<p>We specialise in complex WordPress projects: multi-site networks, WooCommerce stores with custom checkout flows, membership sites, directory websites, booking systems, and WordPress as a headless CMS feeding custom front-end applications.</p>

<h3>WooCommerce Development</h3>

<p>WooCommerce powers the majority of UAE e-commerce stores on WordPress. We build and customise WooCommerce stores with complex product configurations (variable products, subscriptions, bundles), custom checkout flows that reduce cart abandonment, integration with UAE payment gateways (Stripe, PayTabs, Telr, HyperPay, Amazon Payment Services), and API connections to inventory management, fulfilment, and CRM systems.</p>

<p>Our WooCommerce builds are performance-optimised — a critical consideration for e-commerce, where a 1-second page speed improvement can increase conversions by 7% and every millisecond of load time has a measurable impact on revenue.</p>

<h3>Custom Web Applications</h3>

<p>For complex business requirements that go beyond what website CMS platforms can handle, we build custom web applications using modern JavaScript frameworks (React, Next.js, Vue) and robust backend systems (Node.js, PHP Laravel, Python). Whether you need a customer portal, an operations dashboard, a SaaS application, a booking and reservation system, or a complex API-driven platform, we architect and build it for your specific requirements.</p>

<h3>API Development and Integration</h3>

<p>Modern business operations require connected systems. We build RESTful and GraphQL APIs, integrate third-party services (CRM, ERP, payment gateways, shipping, email marketing, accounting, and more), and create the technical bridges that allow your website to communicate with your business systems in real time. Proper API architecture makes your business more efficient and your website more powerful.</p>

<h3>Website Migration and Rebuild</h3>

<p>Migrating an existing website — whether from another platform, another agency\'s work, or an outdated custom build — requires careful planning to preserve SEO value, data integrity, and functionality. We manage migrations with comprehensive redirect mapping, search console monitoring, and post-migration performance verification to ensure your organic rankings are protected through the transition.</p>

<h3>Performance Optimisation</h3>

<p>Website speed is a revenue driver and a ranking factor. We offer standalone performance audits and optimisation services for existing websites struggling with slow load times, poor Core Web Vitals scores, or high server response times. Our optimisation work covers: server configuration and hosting upgrades, caching implementation, image optimisation and next-gen format delivery (WebP/AVIF), JavaScript and CSS minification and deferral, critical CSS inlining, and CDN configuration.</p>

<h2>Technical Standards We Build To</h2>

<h3>Performance</h3>

<p>Every website we deliver is built to achieve Google\'s \"Good\" threshold for Core Web Vitals: LCP under 2.5 seconds, INP under 200ms, and CLS under 0.1. We use server-side rendering or static generation where appropriate to minimise client-side JavaScript, implement aggressive caching strategies, and configure CDN delivery for optimal load times across the UAE and GCC.</p>

<h3>Security</h3>

<p>Website security is non-negotiable — particularly for businesses handling customer data, payment information, or sensitive enquiries. Our security standards include: HTTPS implementation with modern TLS configuration, input validation and SQL injection prevention, XSS (cross-site scripting) protection, CSRF (cross-site request forgery) tokens on all forms, regular dependency updates and vulnerability monitoring, secure file upload handling, and rate limiting on sensitive endpoints.</p>

<p>For WordPress specifically: we implement WordPress security hardening (removing version exposure, limiting login attempts, two-factor authentication for admin, file permission audits) and configure monitoring to detect and alert on suspicious activity.</p>

<h3>Accessibility</h3>

<p>Web accessibility — building sites that work for users with disabilities — is both the right thing to do and, increasingly, a legal requirement in many jurisdictions. We build to WCAG 2.1 AA standards as standard, covering: proper semantic HTML structure, keyboard navigation, screen reader compatibility, sufficient colour contrast, alternative text for images, and accessible form design.</p>

<h3>Code Quality and Maintainability</h3>

<p>All code we write is clean, documented, and maintainable. We follow established coding standards for each language and framework, use version control (Git) throughout every project, write meaningful commit messages, and provide full code documentation in the project handover. When your team or a future developer picks up the project, they should be able to understand it quickly.</p>

<h2>UAE-Specific Development Considerations</h2>

<img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517694712202-14dd9538aa97?w=1100&#038;q=80&#038;auto=format&#038;fit=crop\" alt=\"Full-stack web development — SearchEngineOptimization.ae\" style=\"width:100%;border-radius:12px;margin:2rem 0;aspect-ratio:16/7;object-fit:cover;\" loading=\"lazy\">

<p><strong>Payment gateway integration:</strong> UAE-compliant payment processing requires local gateway options beyond Stripe. We integrate PayTabs, Telr, HyperPay, Amazon Payment Services, and network-branded gateways, ensuring your checkout works seamlessly with UAE-issued Visa, Mastercard, Amex, and Apple Pay.</p>

<p><strong>Arabic language support:</strong> RTL (right-to-left) development for Arabic interfaces requires more than translating content — it means mirrored layouts, correctly-rendered Arabic typography (font selection is critical; not all fonts render Arabic correctly), bidirectional text handling, and appropriately adapted UX patterns. We\'ve delivered fully bilingual Arabic/English applications.</p>

<p><strong>UAE data residency:</strong> Some UAE businesses — particularly in regulated sectors — require data to be stored and processed within the UAE. We architect solutions on UAE cloud infrastructure (Azure UAE North, AWS Bahrain, Oracle UAE) where data residency is a requirement.</p>

<p><strong>Bandwidth and device diversity:</strong> While UAE internet speeds are excellent in urban areas, the device mix is diverse — from premium smartphones to lower-end Android devices. We optimise for the full range of UAE device capabilities, ensuring performance across the spectrum.</p>

<h2>Why Technical Excellence Matters for Business</h2>

<p>The business case for technical excellence is straightforward: a faster website converts better, ranks higher, and retains more users. A secure website protects your reputation and your customers. A well-built website gives your team independence rather than dependency. And a scalable architecture means you don\'t face a costly rebuild when your business grows.</p>

<p>We\'ve seen the consequences of underinvesting in technical quality: websites that can\'t handle traffic spikes and go down during marketing campaigns, e-commerce stores that lose thousands in sales to checkout bugs, and WordPress sites hacked and defaced because of neglected security. Technical investment is insurance against these risks — and it compounds in value over time.</p>

