<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

<h3>What is AI search optimisation and why does it matter for UAE businesses?</h3>
<p>AI search optimisation ensures your brand is featured in ChatGPT, Perplexity, and Google AI Overview responses. 40% of UAE internet users have used AI search tools, and being cited in AI answers drives brand awareness, trust, and direct traffic — a valuable new channel alongside traditional search.</p>

<h3>How do I get my Dubai business featured in ChatGPT responses?</h3>
<p>Build strong presence across authoritative platforms, create comprehensive expert content AI can extract, earn mentions in UAE publications through digital PR, maintain consistent NAP information, and implement comprehensive structured data on your website.</p>

<h3>Will AI search replace Google for UAE users?</h3>
<p>AI search is supplementing, not replacing, Google. Google itself integrates AI (AI Overviews) into search. Most UAE users still use Google for specific queries, price research, and local searches. A dual strategy optimising for both is recommended.</p>

<h3>What is Google AI Overview and how does it affect UAE website traffic?</h3>
<p>AI Overviews appear at the top of results, synthesising answers before organic results. Early data shows 10–30% lower CTRs for informational queries. However, being cited within an AI Overview drives traffic through source attribution links.</p>

<h3>How does E-E-A-T relate to AI search visibility?</h3>
<p>E-E-A-T signals are fundamental to AI visibility. Demonstrating expertise through named authors with credentials, citing authoritative sources, earning media coverage, and maintaining a credible online presence all improve AI citation likelihood.</p>

