<p>Real estate is one of the most competitive fields in Dubai SEO, typically requiring 6–12 months for significant organic traffic growth. Early wins are achievable in 3–4 months for long-tail neighbourhood and investment keywords.</p>

<h3>Should Dubai real estate agencies focus on SEO or portal listings?</h3>
<p>Both serve different purposes. Portal listings drive immediate leads but are increasingly expensive. Your website SEO builds a long-term traffic asset you own and control. The most successful agencies invest in both.</p>

