<h3>Is it worth buying backlinks for a UAE website?</h3>
<p>No. Buying links violates Google\'s guidelines and risks manual penalties that completely remove your site from search results. Invest the same budget in digital PR, content, or legitimate outreach instead.</p>

<h3>How long does link building take to affect UAE rankings?</h3>
<p>New backlinks typically begin influencing rankings within 4–12 weeks. Significant improvements from a link building campaign become visible within 3–6 months. Domain authority improvements take 6–12 months of consistent acquisition.</p>

<h3>What is the best link building strategy for a new UAE business?</h3>
<p>Start with: (1) UAE business directory citations, (2) Chamber of Commerce and industry association memberships, (3) Supplier and partner links, (4) Content targeting UAE media coverage. These build initial authority without risk.</p>

<h3>How do I get featured in Gulf News or Khaleej Times?</h3>
