('127', '0', '2026-07-29 15:18:06', '2026-07-29 15:18:06', '<p>With 9.71 million social media users in the UAE and some of the highest per-capita social media usage rates in the world, <strong>social media marketing</strong> is not optional for Dubai businesses — it\'s essential. But the UAE\'s social landscape is uniquely diverse: a cosmopolitan population speaking dozens of languages, consuming content across multiple platforms, with distinct preferences that differ significantly from Western markets.</p>

<p>This guide gives you the complete platform-by-platform strategy for UAE social media marketing in 2025, with actionable tactics for every major network.</p>

<div style=\"background:#f0f7ff;border-left:4px solid #0066cc;padding:20px 24px;margin:32px 0;border-radius:4px;\">
<h3 style=\"margin-top:0;\">🔑 Key Takeaways</h3>
