        \"text\": \"For new UAE businesses, start with: (1) UAE business directory and citation building for immediate local signals, (2) Chamber of Commerce and industry association memberships, (3) Supplier and partner link requests, (4) Content creation targeting UAE media coverage. These tactics build initial authority without risk and provide a foundation for more advanced strategies.\"
      }
    },
    {
      \"@type\": \"Question\",
      \"name\": \"How do I get featured in Gulf News or Khaleej Times?\",
      \"acceptedAnswer\": {
