('133', '0', '2026-07-29 15:18:22', '2026-07-29 15:18:22', '<p>WordPress powers over 35% of all websites globally — and in the UAE, it\'s the platform of choice for thousands of businesses from startups to enterprise brands. The good news is that WordPress offers exceptional SEO capabilities. The better news? Most UAE WordPress sites aren\'t using those capabilities anywhere near their full potential. <strong>WordPress SEO</strong> done correctly can transform your organic visibility in the UAE market — and this comprehensive guide shows you exactly how.</p>

<div style=\"background:#f0f7ff;border-left:4px solid #0066cc;padding:20px 24px;margin:32px 0;border-radius:4px;\">
<h3 style=\"margin-top:0;\">🔑 Key Takeaways</h3>
<ul>
<li>WordPress powers 65% of UAE business websites using a known CMS</li>
<li>Default WordPress installations have 8–12 common SEO issues that need immediate fixing</li>
