</tr>
<tr>
<td style=\"padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;\">Existing website with some authority, medium competition</td>
<td style=\"padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;\">4–8 months</td>
</tr>
<tr style=\"background:#f9f9f9;\">
<td style=\"padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;\">Competitive keywords (real estate, legal, finance)</td>
<td style=\"padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;\">9–18 months</td>
</tr>
<tr>
