<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

<h3>What is AI search optimisation and why does it matter for UAE businesses?</h3>
<p>AI search optimisation ensures your brand is featured in ChatGPT, Perplexity, and Google AI Overview responses. 40% of UAE internet users have used AI search tools, and being cited in AI answers drives brand awareness, trust, and direct traffic — a valuable new channel alongside traditional search.</p>

<h3>How do I get my Dubai business featured in ChatGPT responses?</h3>
