<h3>NAP Consistency: Non-Negotiable</h3>
<p>Every citation must use exactly the same format for your business name, address, and phone number. Even small inconsistencies (\"Trading LLC\" vs \"Trading L.L.C.\", \"+971 4 123 4567\" vs \"04 123 4567\") confuse Google\'s local algorithm. Audit your existing citations with BrightLocal or Whitespark to identify and correct inconsistencies.</p>

<h2>Local SEO Content Strategy for Dubai</h2>
<p>Content tailored for Dubai\'s local search queries captures high-intent searchers that generic content misses.</p>

<h3>Location Landing Pages</h3>
<p>If your business serves multiple areas in Dubai or across the UAE, create dedicated landing pages for each location. A legal firm might create pages for \"Legal Services Dubai Marina\", \"Lawyers Downtown Dubai\", \"Law Firm Business Bay\" — each targeting the specific area\'s search queries.</p>

<p>Effective location pages include:</p>
<ul>
<li>Area-specific content (local landmarks, community context, why you serve this area)</li>
<li>Embedded Google Map</li>
<li>Local contact details</li>
<li>Local schema markup</li>
<li>Area-specific testimonials from clients in that neighbourhood</li>
</ul>

<h3>Dubai Neighbourhood Content</h3>
<p>Blog posts targeting Dubai neighbourhood searches (\"Things to Do in Dubai Marina\", \"Best Cafes in JBR\", \"Healthcare Options in Downtown Dubai\") attract local organic traffic that builds GBP authority through website engagement signals.</p>

<h2>Technical Local SEO for UAE Websites</h2>

<h3>Local Business Schema Markup</h3>
<p>Implement LocalBusiness schema on every page of your website. The most important fields for Dubai businesses:</p>
<ul>
<li><code>name</code>: Exact business name</li>
<li><code>address</code>: Full UAE postal address with PostalAddress schema</li>
<li><code>telephone</code>: UAE format phone number</li>
<li><code>openingHours</code>: Complete week including Friday/Saturday weekend</li>
<li><code>geo</code>: Latitude and longitude coordinates</li>
<li><code>url</code>: Website URL</li>
<li><code>sameAs</code>: Links to your GBP, Facebook, LinkedIn profiles</li>
</ul>

<h3>Mobile Optimisation for Local Search</h3>
<p>\"Near me\" searches are almost entirely mobile. If your website isn\'t perfectly optimised for mobile — fast loading, easy to navigate, click-to-call phone number, WhatsApp button — you\'re losing local leads regardless of your search rankings.</p>

<h2>Tracking Local SEO Success in Dubai</h2>
<p>Monitor these metrics monthly to gauge local SEO progress:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>GBP Insights:</strong> Views, direction requests, phone calls, website clicks from your GBP</li>
<li><strong>Map pack ranking positions:</strong> Use Local Falcon or BrightLocal to track rankings across Dubai postcodes</li>
<li><strong>Local keyword rankings:</strong> Track \"[service] Dubai\" keywords in Search Console</li>
<li><strong>Review velocity:</strong> Number of new reviews per month and average rating</li>
<li><strong>Citation audit:</strong> Quarterly check of NAP consistency across all citation sources</li>
</ul>

