        \"text\": \"There\'s no magic number, but competitive analysis of Dubai map pack results shows top-ranked businesses typically have 30–100+ reviews with a 4.5+ average rating. More important than raw numbers is review velocity (getting reviews consistently over time) and review quality (specific, detailed reviews with relevant keywords).\"
      }
    },
    {
      \"@type\": \"Question\",
      \"name\": \"How long does local SEO take to show results in Dubai?\",
      \"acceptedAnswer\": {
