        \"text\": \"Local SEO in Dubai typically shows initial results within 4–8 weeks — faster than national SEO because competition is more localised. GBP optimisation and citation building can produce visible ranking improvements within 4–6 weeks. Sustained local authority building (reviews, backlinks) shows compound improvements over 3–6 months.\"
      }
    },
    {
      \"@type\": \"Question\",
      \"name\": \"What is the most important factor for local SEO in Dubai?\",
