        \"@type\": \"Answer\",
        \"text\": \"Google Business Profile optimisation and review management are the most controllable and highest-impact local SEO factors for Dubai businesses. A fully optimised GBP with consistent review generation significantly outperforms incomplete profiles with few reviews, regardless of other SEO factors.\"
      }
    },
    {
      \"@type\": \"Question\",
      \"name\": \"Do I need separate Google Business Profiles for different Dubai locations?\",
      \"acceptedAnswer\": {
        \"@type\": \"Answer\",
        \"text\": \"Yes — each physical location should have its own Google Business Profile. This allows each location to appear in map searches for its specific area. For service businesses without physical locations, a single GBP with defined service areas is appropriate. Never create fake or duplicate listings — this violates Google\'s guidelines and risks suspension.\"
