        \"text\": \"A few negative reviews among many positive ones is normal and actually increases credibility (purely perfect reviews can seem fake). However, a consistent pattern of negative reviews, low average ratings (below 3.5), or reviews mentioning specific quality issues will negatively impact both local rankings and consumer click-through rates. Address negative feedback promptly and professionally.\"
      }
