        \"text\": \"NAP stands for Name, Address, Phone — the three pieces of information that identify your local business. Consistency means using exactly the same format everywhere your business appears online. Inconsistencies confuse Google\'s local algorithm and reduce local ranking authority. For Dubai businesses, common inconsistency issues include varying company name formats (LLC vs L.L.C.) and different phone number formats (+971 vs 04).\"
