<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

<h3>How do I get my Dubai business to appear in Google\'s map pack?</h3>
<p>Create and fully complete your Google Business Profile. Collect Google reviews consistently. Build consistent NAP citations across UAE directories. Ensure your website has LocalBusiness schema. Build backlinks from UAE-relevant websites.</p>

<h3>How many Google reviews does a Dubai business need to rank locally?</h3>
<p>Competitive Dubai map pack businesses typically have 30–100+ reviews with 4.5+ average rating. More important than raw numbers is review velocity (consistent over time) and review quality (specific, detailed reviews mentioning relevant keywords).</p>

<h3>How long does local SEO take to show results in Dubai?</h3>
<p>Local SEO typically shows initial results within 4–8 weeks — faster than national SEO. GBP optimisation and citation building show ranking improvements within 4–6 weeks. Review building and link acquisition show compound improvements over 3–6 months.</p>

<h3>What is the most important factor for local SEO in Dubai?</h3>
<p>Google Business Profile optimisation combined with consistent review generation. A fully optimised GBP with ongoing reviews significantly outperforms incomplete profiles with few reviews, regardless of other factors.</p>

<h3>Can negative reviews hurt my Dubai local SEO rankings?</h3>
<p>A few negatives among many positives is normal. However, a consistent pattern of negative reviews or low average ratings will negatively impact local rankings and consumer click-through rates. Address negative feedback promptly and professionally.</p>

<h2>Dominate Dubai Local Search Today</h2>
<p>Local SEO is the most direct path to more calls, visits, and customers for Dubai businesses serving local customers. Our <a href=\"/dubai/\">Dubai SEO specialists</a> build comprehensive local strategies that put your business at the top of map searches across the emirate.</p>

<p><a href=\"/contact/\">Get a free local SEO audit</a> — we\'ll assess your GBP, citations, reviews, and local rankings, then build a tailored Dubai local SEO strategy. Explore our full range of <a href=\"/services/search-engine-optimization/\">SEO services</a> or see how local SEO success has driven growth for our <a href=\"/case-studies/\">UAE clients</a>.</p>

