<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

<h3>How does voice search work for local businesses in Dubai?</h3>
<p>Voice queries with local intent trigger Google to use Google Business Profile data for answers. The business with the most complete, accurate, and well-reviewed GBP in the relevant area typically receives the voice search recommendation. GBP optimisation is the most direct path to local voice visibility.</p>

<h3>What is a featured snippet and why is it important for voice search?</h3>
<p>Featured snippets (Position 0) are the boxed answers above organic results. Voice assistants read featured snippets as their answers — owning one means your content is read aloud when UAE users ask that question. It\'s the voice search equivalent of ranking #1.</p>

<h3>Does Arabic voice search require different optimisation?</h3>
<p>Yes. Arabic voice search requires content with proper lang=\"ar\" and dir=\"rtl\" attributes, Arabic keyword research, Arabic FAQ schema, and Arabic text in your GBP description. The Arabic voice search opportunity in the UAE is significant and currently underserved.</p>

<h3>What percentage of UAE searches are voice searches?</h3>
<p>Approximately 25–30% of UAE mobile searches are voice searches, with the figure growing rapidly. The UAE has one of the highest voice search usage rates globally due to high smartphone penetration and multilingual population demographics.</p>

<h3>Which voice assistant is most popular in the UAE?</h3>
<p>Google Assistant dominates UAE voice search due to Google\'s overwhelming market share. Siri is widely used among iPhone-heavy UAE demographics. For most businesses, optimising for Google-powered voice search (drawing from GBP and featured snippets) delivers the highest reach.</p>

<h2>Prepare Your UAE Business for Conversational Search</h2>
<p>Voice search isn\'t the future — it\'s the present for UAE consumers. Our <a href=\"/services/search-engine-optimization/\">SEO specialists</a> build voice-search-ready strategies that capture both traditional and conversational search traffic across Dubai and the UAE.</p>

<p><a href=\"/contact/\">Get a free voice search audit</a> — we\'ll identify your featured snippet opportunities, FAQ content gaps, and local voice search optimisation priorities. Also read about <a href=\"/services/ai-search-optimization/\">AI search optimisation</a> to prepare for the broader conversational search revolution.</p>

