  <h3>Real Estate</h3>
  <p>Dubai\'s real estate sector is one of the most competitive digital markets in the world. Buyers increasingly ask AI tools questions like \"Is it a good time to buy property in Dubai Marina?\" or \"Which Dubai developer has the best off-plan payment plans?\" — complex questions where only authoritative, well-structured content earns a citation. We position real estate firms as the expert voice AI turns to for these queries.</p>

  <h3>Healthcare &amp; Clinics</h3>
  <p>Patients across the UAE use AI to research symptoms, treatments, and healthcare providers before booking appointments. Healthcare content requires exceptional E-E-A-T signals — verified medical authorship, citations from peer-reviewed sources, and clear expertise indicators. Our healthcare AI optimization packages are specifically designed to meet these elevated trust requirements.</p>

  <h3>Financial Services</h3>
  <p>Banks, investment firms, and insurance companies in Dubai benefit enormously from AI citations because financial queries trigger high-intent, high-value customer journeys. When ChatGPT recommends a mortgage provider or a wealth management firm in response to a user\'s question, that recommendation can initiate a six-figure client relationship.</p>

  <h3>Hospitality &amp; Tourism</h3>
