        \"text\": \"Yes. Bilingual Arabic/English development is a specialisation of ours. True Arabic RTL support goes beyond CSS — it requires rethinking layout logic, typography, form behaviour, and icon direction. We build bilingual sites using WordPress multilingual plugins with proper language switching, hreflang tags for SEO, and native RTL CSS.\"
      }
    },
    {
      \"@type\": \"Question\",
      \"name\": \"What happens if my website breaks after launch?\",
      \"acceptedAnswer\": {
        \"@type\": \"Answer\",
        \"text\": \"All clients on our monthly maintenance plans have priority support response times — typically same-day for non-critical issues, and within 2 hours for site-down emergencies. We maintain recent backups for rapid restoration. For clients not on a maintenance plan, we provide paid emergency support.\"
      }
    },
    {
      \"@type\": \"Question\",
      \"name\": \"Can you take over maintenance of a website someone else built?\",
      \"acceptedAnswer\": {
        \"@type\": \"Answer\",
        \"text\": \"Yes. We regularly take on maintenance of websites built by previous agencies or freelancers. We conduct a full technical audit first to assess the current state of the codebase, security, performance, and technical debt. The audit cost is credited against any subsequent project.\"
      }
    },
    {
      \"@type\": \"Question\",
      \"name\": \"Do you build accessible websites compliant with WCAG 2.1?\",
      \"acceptedAnswer\": {
