        \"text\": \"Yes. We build to WCAG 2.1 Level AA as a baseline standard. This includes sufficient colour contrast, keyboard navigability, screen reader compatibility with ARIA labels, alternative text for images, and focus indicators. Accessibility also improves SEO — accessible HTML is semantically correct HTML.\"
      }
    },
    {
      \"@type\": \"Question\",
      \"name\": \"Will my website perform well on Google Core Web Vitals?\",
      \"acceptedAnswer\": {
        \"@type\": \"Answer\",
        \"text\": \"Yes — we target 85+ on Google PageSpeed Insights mobile score for every project. This requires performance-conscious development: optimised images in WebP format, minimised CSS and JavaScript, efficient font loading, CDN delivery for static assets, and server-side caching. We verify Core Web Vitals compliance before launch.\"
      }
    },
    {
      \"@type\": \"Question\",
      \"name\": \"Do you offer e-commerce development for UAE businesses?\",
      \"acceptedAnswer\": {
        \"@type\": \"Answer\",
        \"text\": \"Yes. We build WooCommerce stores integrated with UAE payment gateways (Stripe, PayTabs, Telr, HyperPay, Amazon Payment Services), UAE shipping providers, and VAT calculation systems. We handle complex product configurations and pay particular attention to mobile checkout flow, as 68% of UAE e-commerce transactions are completed on mobile.\"
      }
    },
    {
      \"@type\": \"Question\",
      \"name\": \"What is your development quality assurance process?\",
      \"acceptedAnswer\": {
        \"@type\": \"Answer\",
        \"text\": \"Every project goes through cross-browser testing, cross-device testing, functionality testing of all forms and interactive elements, performance testing, security scanning, accessibility checking, and SEO technical review. We maintain a pre-launch checklist with over 60 checkpoints that every project must pass.\"
      }
