      \"name\": \"Do you offer e-commerce development for UAE businesses?\",
      \"acceptedAnswer\": {
        \"@type\": \"Answer\",
        \"text\": \"Yes. We build WooCommerce stores integrated with UAE payment gateways (Stripe, PayTabs, Telr, HyperPay, Amazon Payment Services), UAE shipping providers, and VAT calculation systems. We handle complex product configurations and pay particular attention to mobile checkout flow, as 68% of UAE e-commerce transactions are completed on mobile.\"
      }
    },
    {
      \"@type\": \"Question\",
      \"name\": \"What is your development quality assurance process?\",
      \"acceptedAnswer\": {
        \"@type\": \"Answer\",
        \"text\": \"Every project goes through cross-browser testing, cross-device testing, functionality testing of all forms and interactive elements, performance testing, security scanning, accessibility checking, and SEO technical review. We maintain a pre-launch checklist with over 60 checkpoints that every project must pass.\"
      }
    },
    {
      \"@type\": \"Question\",
      \"name\": \"Can you build custom web applications, not just websites?\",
      \"acceptedAnswer\": {
        \"@type\": \"Answer\",
        \"text\": \"Yes. We build custom web applications including SaaS products, client portals, booking systems, directory and marketplace platforms, membership sites, and internal business tools using our Laravel or Node.js back-end stack with React or Next.js front-end.\"
      }
    },
    {
      \"@type\": \"Question\",
      \"name\": \"Do you provide source code and documentation after the project?\",
      \"acceptedAnswer\": {
        \"@type\": \"Answer\",
        \"text\": \"Absolutely. All source code is owned by the client. We deliver projects via a version-controlled Git repository with comprehensive technical documentation covering system architecture, deployment procedures, integrations, and CMS usage. We never retain ownership of client code.\"
      }
    },
    {
      \"@type\": \"Question\",
      \"name\": \"How do I start a web development project with you?\",
      \"acceptedAnswer\": {
        \"@type\": \"Answer\",
        \"text\": \"Start with a free discovery call where we discuss your project requirements, technical constraints, integration needs, and timeline. Following the call, we provide a detailed proposal with a fixed price, timeline, and deliverables specification. There are no hidden costs and no ongoing retainer obligations beyond the agreed project scope.\"
      }
    }
  ]
}
</script>
', 'Web Development Services Dubai — WordPress, React & Custom Builds', 'Fast, secure, and scalable web development. From WordPress to custom platforms, we build digital infrastructure that performs under real-world conditions.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '18-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-07-29 17:57:50', '2026-07-29 17:57:50', '', '18', 'http://localhost:8000/?p=162', '0', 'revision', '', '0');

